// @contract: C-013
// Graduated from proofs/wall-corpus/map_of_maps_value.almd at the commissioning
// switchover: the structural emitter lowers the shape the incumbent
// refused (map.set_hval_wall), byte-verified on both targets.
// A Map whose VALUES are Maps (`Map[String, Map[String, Int]]`): the
// heap-valued map ctor/set generics route to the `_hval_wall` refusal names
// — linking the scalar-value generic would store a raw handle without its
// ownership transfer and free the inner map out from under the outer.
// `Map[String, List[Int]]` (list-valued) IS registered and votes
// (spec/wasm_cross/nested_map_list_values.almd); map-valued is the next
// registry entry, not a silent admission.
fn main() -> Unit = {
  var mm: Map[String, Map[String, Int]] = map.new()
  var row: Map[String, Int] = map.new()
  map.set(row, "x", 7)
  map.set(mm, "r1", row)
  println(int.to_string(map.get_or(map.get_or(mm, "r1", map.new()), "x", 0 - 1)))
}
